            "type": "text",
            "text": "Pattern notes"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Mesh row: ch 4 (counts as dc, ch 1), * dc in next dc, ch 1; rep to end, dc in top of t-ch. The foundation chain sets the width; use a multiple of 2 plus 1."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Foundation"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Chain 73 (for 35 repeats, approx. 45 cm wide after blocking). Row 1: dc in 4th ch from hook, * ch 1, skip 1 ch, dc in next ch; rep to end. Turn. (36 dc)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Body"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Every row: ch 4, * "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "dc-mesh-l3"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "dc"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " in next dc, ch 1; rep to end, dc in top of t-ch. Turn."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Work to 200 cm length (approx. 240 rows) or desired length. The rectangle can be any length you like."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Finishing"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Fasten off. Weave in ends. Wet the piece and pin it flat to its full dimensions. "
